      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/lemoyne_ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lemoyne rests on fertile loamy soils that were once part of the Great Black Swamp, now prized for farming.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
